        <p class="iw-text"><strong>Chain Control level R-2</strong></p>
        <p class="iw-text"><strong>Location: </strong>Twin Bridges</p>
        <p class="iw-text">Chains or traction devices are required on all vehicles except four wheel/ all wheel drive vehicles with snow-tread tires on all four wheels. (Four wheel/all wheel drive vehicles must carry traction devices in chain control areas).</p>
        <p class="iw-text"><strong>Effective from: </strong>11/13/2026 15:18</p>
        <div font-size:xx-small;'>District: 3 Message ID: 9011</div>
        
