        <p class="iw-text"><strong>Chain Control level R-1</strong></p>
        <p class="iw-text"><strong>Location: </strong>Old Mammoth Rd.</p>
        <p class="iw-text">Chains are required on all vehicles except passenger vehicles and light-duty trucks under 6,000 pounds gross weight and equipped with snow tires on at least two drive wheels. Chains must be carried by vehicles using snow tires. All vehicles towing trailers must have chains on one drive axle. Trailers with brakes must have chains on at least one axle.</p>
